{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet town of Edinborough, a trio of high school boys get wise to\u00a0unnatural beasts\u00a0oozing out of a facility\u00a0tucked away in the mountains. Across town, a hard-nosed gumshoe and a cocky street tough chase the story of some poor soul who got too close to the truth. As their paths twist, the deeper they dig, the darker the mystery becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754300/extras/283727b1db3720d0859f7b03642a759d.avif?t=1752487703\" data-has-big width=800 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through thick woods, quiet waters, grimy streets, abandoned shafts, every path leads to more trouble than they bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754300/extras/1ddb2e0f1dc200fe2baddf45f83960b4.avif?t=1752487703\" data-has-big width=800 height=606 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rip-roarin\u2019 15+ hours\u00a0of mystery, mayhem, and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced turn-based brawls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See trouble coming a mile away\u2014no surprise encounters, you\u2019ll spot those goons before they spot you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 16-bit style and soundtrack straight outta the past\u2014Taking cues from the golden age of RPGs.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754300?t=1752487703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754300/47026cbe1dd46810836dcbddc98552e027b97070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752487703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754300/f9a5714